Description: POSIX Shell function library
 POSHLI is a lightweight, general-purpose shell function library built
 around portable POSIX shell syntax and widely available standard
 utilities. It provides reusable functions for automation, text
 processing, validation and everyday scripting.
 .
 The library is distributed as a single generated file (poshli.sh)
 ready for inclusion with the POSIX dot command. It has no runtime
 dependency on Python, Perl, Node.js or the external base64 command.
